ers/Bootstrap-Paradox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-12-03T04:10:17Z","updated_at":"2021-12-03T04:10:17Z","body":"Hey! I'm relatively new to Open Source Contribution, Is there anything I could be helpful for!😃","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/985199900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Bootstrap-Paradox","id":53016712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDE2NzEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53016712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox","html_url":"https://github.com/Bootstrap-Paradox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bootstrap-Paradox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/1018672289","html_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/10189#issuecomment-1018672289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/10189","id":1018672289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAGuhRc48t7Sh","user":{"login":"alexbouayad","id":55853079,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODUzMDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55853079?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad","html_url":"https://github.com/alexbouayad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-01-21T16:37:39Z","updated_at":"2022-01-21T16:38:43Z","body":"> This is a syntax error in 3.8 and later, presumably because it has no useful behavior: https://docs.python.org/3.10/whatsnew/3.8.html#changes-in-python-behavior. Perhaps mypy should just produce an error for it in any Python version.\r\n\r\nIt is indeed reported as a syntax error in 3.8 and later when compiling, but not when only building the AST, preventing mypy from catching the error before processing the graph. \r\n\r\nThe following raises `SyntaxError` (with python 3.9.9).\r\n\r\n```\r\nsource = \"\"\"from typing import Generator\r\n\r\ndef f() -> Generator[int, None, str]:\r\n    yield 1\r\n    return \"lol\"\r\n\r\n[(yield from f()) for lel in range(5)]\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\ncompile(source, filename=\"<string>\", mode=\"exec\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe following raises no exception.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfrom ast import parse\r\n\r\nparse(source)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/1018672289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alexbouayad","id":55853079,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODUzMDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55853079?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad","html_url":"https://github.com/alexbouayad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexbouayad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/1018682313","html_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/10189#issuecomment-1018682313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/10189","id":1018682313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAGuhRc48t9vJ","user":{"login":"JelleZijlstra","id":906600,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjYwMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/906600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JelleZijlstra","html_url":"https://github.com/JelleZijlstra","followers_url":"https://